WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:22.202
Jemima hiked up a big hill.

2
00:00:22.203 --> 00:00:25.708
From the top she saw a forest.

3
00:00:25.709 --> 00:00:29.801
It was very far away.

4
00:00:29.802 --> 00:00:36.012
"I'll lay my eggs there," she said.

5
00:00:36.013 --> 00:00:42.256
Jemima ran and flapped her wings.

6
00:00:42.257 --> 00:00:46.419
Up, up, up she went.

7
00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:49.560
Jemima flew through the air.

8
00:00:49.561 --> 00:00:54.744
Soon she was flying over the forest.

9
00:00:54.745 --> 00:01:00.862
She saw a nice spot and landed.

10
00:01:00.863 --> 00:01:05.979
Jemima took a few steps and stopped.

11
00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:10.104
A stranger sat on a tree stump.

12
00:01:10.105 --> 00:01:14.303
He wore fancy clothes.

13
00:01:14.304 --> 00:01:18.314
Jemima didn't know that he was a fox!

14
00:01:18.315 --> 00:01:21.572
The fox looked up from his newspaper.

15
00:01:21.573 --> 00:01:26.025
He smiled.

16
00:01:26.026 --> 00:01:30.049
"Hello," said the fox.

17
00:01:30.050 --> 00:01:33.748
"Are you lost?"

18
00:01:33.749 --> 00:01:38.860
"What a nice gentleman," thought Jemima.

19
00:01:38.861 --> 00:01:43.081
"No, I'm not lost," she said.

20
00:01:43.082 --> 00:01:46.420
"I need a place to lay my eggs."

21
00:01:46.421 --> 00:01:49.451
The fox grinned.

22
00:01:49.452 --> 00:01:54.185
"I love eggs!" he said.

23
00:01:54.186 --> 00:01:58.450
"And I love little ducklings!"

24
00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:01.631
"Oh?" said Jemima.

25
00:02:01.632 --> 00:02:05.574
"Come with me, dear," said the fox.

26
00:02:05.575 --> 00:02:09.136
His teeth sparkled in the sun.

27
00:02:09.137 --> 00:02:12.541
"You can lay your eggs in my shed.

28
00:02:12.542 --> 00:02:21.532
They will be very safe there."
